  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge contract &quot;Support Facility to EU Delegations on the Implementation of country allocations of the Human Rights and Democracy Thematic Programme&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the service contract&amp;nbsp;is to&amp;nbsp;enhance the implementation of EU actions promoting and protecting human rights and democracy in partner countries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This support aims more specifically at:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Providing technical support to EU Delegations on the implementation in the framework of country allocations of the Human Rights and Democracy Thematic Programme.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The global and specific objectives of this service contract will contribute to the crosscutting objectives of EU funded actions: environment and climate change, human rights-based approach, persons living with disabilities, and gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
